<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Jan 10, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Jan 10   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,863    2,917 10,315</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     138	 94    320</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    863	863  1,306</p>
<p>Total					 3,864    3,874 11,941</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,598    1,500   unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     286	285   unq</p>
<p>CCC stocks				  3,558    3,583   unq</p>
<p>Total					 5,442    5,368   unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
